  "description": "PIYVIG crystallizes in the triclinic crystal system with space group P -1. Reported CIF formula moiety: C54 H68 Dy4 N4 O22. From the CIF bond table, Dy1 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy2 (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Dy1A (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy2A (Dy) has 8 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 5 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.565-3.766 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 91.56-105.39°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C54H68Dy4N4O22. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 2 NO3 (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)).",
